---

mysql-mcp-server uses github.com/go-sql-driver/mysql (Mozilla Public License 2.0)
https://github.com/go-sql-driver/mysql

Diagnostic queries follow MySQL 8 reference documentation for
Performance Schema, sys schema, InnoDB locking, and replication tables.
The Oracle HeatWave/MySQL AI MCP is not vendored here.

---

host-logs-mcp-server is original to this repository. Path allowlisting
follows the idea of the MCP filesystem reference server (directory
roots, reject "..", resolve before use). MCP Roots are treated as
advisory only, not a sandbox. Remote commands are fixed
find/grep/awk/tail templates with POSIX quoting (OWASP MCP05), not a
generic SSH exec MCP. Password and inline private-key authentication use
golang.org/x/crypto/ssh; legacy key-file-only configuration retains OpenSSH
BatchMode. Credentials stay in private
local configuration and are not returned by target tools.

Go SSH dependencies: golang.org/x/crypto and golang.org/x/sys,
